After the long game we take a break.
We are taking a short break now.
We stand together by the court and drink water.
Max looks at me.
"What do you like to do in Berlin, Maya?" he asks.
I think for a moment.
"I really like to ride my bicycle," I answer.
"I explore the city."
"And I like to drink good coffee."
Timo nods and smiles.
"You play badminton really well," he says.
"Can you play tennis too?"
I laugh out loud.
"No, unfortunately I cannot play tennis," I say.
"I can only play badminton."
Lena takes her water bottle.
"We want to play another game in a moment," she says.
"Do you want to join in again, Maya?" Max asks.
"Yes, very much," I answer.
We go back onto the court together.
